  "prefLabel": "Ve-H 220.02 Contents of Explanation",
  "priorExpiration": "2018-12-26",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ve-H 220.02 Contents of Explanation. The board shall, within 60 calendar days of receiving a request in accordance with Ve-H 220.01, provide a written response which:\n\n(a) Concisely states the meaning of the rule adopted;\n\n(b) Concisely states the principal reasons for and against the adoption of the rule in its final form; and\n\n(c) States, if the board did so, why the board overruled any arguments and considerations presented against the rule.\n\nSource. #8952, eff 7-21-07, EXPIRED: 7-21-15\n\nNew. #12563, INTERIM, eff 6-28-18, EXPIRED: 12-26-18\n\nNew. #12711, eff 1-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ve-h100-400.html"
